// vertical bar are drawn like its segments (same slant, rounded corners and inner border:
// each piece is three contours 0.25 apart). The sign is drawn 24.86 right of where a full
// digit is centered, so its center is as far from the center of a leading '1' as the
// centers of two full digits are from each other.
